From 909ea3b7ded0ca870f5fd22cb2186afea40a6f78 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mamam Kasir Dev <dev@mamamayam.local>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 08:31:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: full POS/Kasir checkout flow (menu grid -> variant ->
 cart -> voucher/discount -> payment -> receipt)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Logic/flow ported from mamam-global's React reference (App.jsx calculation
chain, usePosStore, CartDrawer, PaymentModal, ReceiptModal) per golden rule
'legacy app is behavior/logic reference only' — UI rebuilt distinct for
Flutter/Riverpod, using this app's own design tokens and stack-navigation
pattern.

Scope decisions (explicit user calls):
- No loyalty points (per PRD, points no longer used)
- Voucher IS included — explicit override of AGENTS.md's 'active
  points/vouchers' forbidden-scope rule
- No shift-must-be-open constraint yet (shift not built)
- Courier cash-holding/delivery-money-to-kurir explicitly deferred

DB schema (v2): variant groups gained is_required/max_selection, variant
options gained extra_price, added customers/vouchers/transactions/
transaction_items tables. Transactions are snapshots (never recomputed
from live menu/settings later), per PRD.

New POS feature module:
- Domain: CartItem (+CartItemBuilder for variant-combo cart line dedup),
  Customer, Voucher, OrderType/PaymentMethod/SplitPayment/OjolPlatform,
  Transaction, CartState, CheckoutCalculator (subtotal -> voucher discount
  -> manual discount -> tax -> service -> delivery -> total -> rounding,
  same formula order as the reference app), PaymentModalState, quick-cash
  suggestions
- Application (Riverpod, the Zustand-store equivalent): PosRepository
  (menu/customer/voucher reads, transaction writes), CartController,
  PosCatalogController, PaymentModalController — each its own
  StateNotifierProvider, payment kept separate from cart per the
  reference app's rationale (typing an amount shouldn't rebuild the cart)
- Presentation: VariantSelectionModal (required/max-selection rules,
  extra price), CartDrawer (customer picker, order type incl. Ojol
  auto-resets discounts/voucher, delivery fee, qty steppers, voucher +
  manual discount, totals), CustomerPickerSheet, PaymentModal (single +
  split payment, quick-cash chips, Ojol platform+order-number, change),
  ReceiptModal (itemized digital struk), PosScreen (menu grid,
  search+category filter, cart FAB)

Wired: Dashboard's 'Kasir' quick action now pushes PosScreen (was a stub).

Also: Menu Management's VariantGroup model extended in place (isRequired,
maxSelection, options now VariantOption objects with extraPrice) since
this is the same underlying data POS needed — repository, provider, and
the three widgets that rendered plain-string options were updated to match.
